# %name% plugin

%description%

To use it, add `%name%` to the plugins array in your zshrc file:

```zsh
plugins=(... %name%)
```

## Aliases

| Alias        | Command            | Description           |
| :----------- | ------------------ | :-------------------- |
| `%command%s` | `%command% status` | Show %command% status |

## Requirements

This plugin requires [%command%](https://example.com) to be installed.
